<p>This is a collaboration SCP between me (Amuness Creeps) and DreamwalkerFae.</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Project Time:</strong> 41 days</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Image credits:</strong> Credit goes to the Visual Records for the image of SCP-2341. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Credit goes to djkaktus for the SCP logo on the timeline chart</span> Credit goes to LurkD for providing the notebook paper image on Addendum 2341.3. I created the site48 logo on the time chart</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Credits for critique:</strong> Professor Will, Dr Hysteria, WoggleBug, Soundchaser, TwistedGears and various people from site19 (i.e. minmin)</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Post:</strong> For right now, this is an experimental upload of the SCP to see if it survives or not. Fae and I agreed to do this. If it falls into the negative range or is at 1 to 10 up votes, then the article will get deleted and it will be significantly edited. However, if this SCP goes past 10 up votes and to the twenties range, then that’s great!</p>
<p>When 2 days have past or when staff put in tags, then I will declare this as a successful SCP. I really like short SCPs as they’re easy to read and don’t really need to go into full detail of things. Short ones are the best as they’re quick and easy to read with a story behind it :]</p>
<p>Crossing my fingers that this goes well.</p>
<p>30 upvotes!? MY LIFE IS COMPLETE!! (Well not really) &gt;_&gt;</p>
<p>OK 44 up votes is amazing thank you</p>

